title the aliases this parser refuses

# The reference parser accepts "left" and "right" and binds them the
# opposite way round from the harness, where onto is RT_DS_RIGHT and
# off-of is RT_DS_LEFT. Silently mirroring a fixture is the worst
# thing a loader can do, so this parser refuses them. Kept out of the
# cross-parser diff because the divergence is the point.

tree left
  1-1: /

tree right
  1-1: /
